cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "x0ne-Harness"
abstract: >-
  Safety harness for coding agents, in Rust: typed actions, a policy on every
  call, snapshots to undo, a journal of the agent's actions. Agent commands
  run under bubblewrap by default (read-only root, writes only in the allowed
  paths, no network). The runtime, the orchestrator and the MCP server are
  the three binaries that make install builds.
authors:
  - name: "x0ne"
version: "0.2.0"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/x0ne-labs/x0ne-Harness"
keywords:
  - sandbox
  - coding-agents
  - bubblewrap
  - mcp
  - rust
